+# Perf history
+
+## Real transcript ingest
+
+No measured figures for ingesting this project's own real Claude Code
+transcript (size in MB, turns produced, episodes produced, ingest duration)
+could be found in this checkout.
+
+What exists instead:
+
+- `crates/muninn-capture/src/lib.rs` has a smoke test
+  (`parses_real_transcripts_when_present`) that, when run on a machine with
+  `~/.claude/projects/-home-ilien-Projects-muninn/*.jsonl` present, parses a
+  real transcript and prints turn/episode/tool counts — but it does not
+  record a transcript size or an ingest duration, and this sandboxed
+  environment has no access to `~/.claude/projects` to run it.
+- `research/00-evidence-log.md` and `design/ENGINE.md` report a *synthetic*
+  benchmark instead: ingesting 200 generated records into a 50,000-record
+  store took 80 ms, plus 195 ms for the subsequent index `optimize` (275 ms
+  total per session-sized batch). That is not a real transcript and is not a
+  substitute for the requested figures.
+
+This section should be filled in with actual numbers once a real transcript
+ingest is measured (e.g. via `muninn ingest <transcript>` or the `Stop`/
+`SessionEnd` hook path, timed, against this project's own transcript file).
